 positive $x$-axis. \n\nTherefore, the angle it makes with the negative $x$-axis is \n\n$$\n\\pi -\\frac{5\\pi }{8}=\\frac{3\\pi }{8}.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe correct answer is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040587/assets/da2dcf4835abda052f4e7e865fcb652abf5a2d4a482d64ba062e39030e5596c6.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-120618/selection/fde4a96d006199488c91b97fbd10eae7563924e4d9e8de8dd2b41163eab776ca" :answer/id #uuid "e25b53a7-63f5-59f4-abb3-74803d59cd55" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040587/assets/845a2af0d45ea2f46e6380863a317711b33c2d6cb662a882c6b76a48efac0c79.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120618/selection/424abd8d32385542e0c8a6adfb0e87007ee1eeb45bf9aec61eb99a068611f410" :answer/id #uuid "e5ed818a-1bec-51d0-ac59-fec6b4c187a0" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040587/assets/7f64e9e1818e9fd9b8375e6759f120a44a04e359cd622b2c55203b4a2060716b.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120618/selection/9fb54c058d8df394455d456240cb5014dcad49117cc438e301b8ce2b2576e3aa" :answer/id #uuid "584d02aa-90e8-5986-a19f-b10ca8955f5c" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040587/assets/7fc410b5c25ac19447288dbd50aa7621aac0c86f4a863787a8a12c5adb53686e.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120618/selection/c7428e8554a74c2cc7b3cc7b10270e364b1153e1423c9ab90f42f861befebd57" :answer/id #uuid "e2e3c0a9-9dcc-5807-8eda-e7dd9f23cf61" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040587/assets/